any that doesn't buy uniforms or branded workwear never gets an email. Apollo, Sales Navigator, Clay or ZoomInfo:\nwhichever you already pay for.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Your parts 1 to 3, one list per industry you give: construction, HVAC, plumbing, electrical, landscaping, automotive, property management,\nrestaurants and hospitality, gyms and fitness, warehouses and logistics, home services, multi-location businesses and companies with large\nemployee teams. A company that doesn't buy uniforms or branded workwear never gets an email. Apollo, Sales Navigator, Clay or ZoomInfo:\nwhichever you already pay for.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_30", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": -26, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -10, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - VERIFY AND CLEAN", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - VERIFY AND CLEAN", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 26, "width": 656, "height": 32, "a